<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20">WiFi</td>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20">⚠️ Sí, però pot pausar-se en hores punta</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20">Endolls</td>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20">✅ Disponibles</td>
